    {"id":"data-analysis-001","category":"资料分析","subtype":"基期量","difficulty":"easy","stem":"2024年该市地区生产总值约为多少亿元？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-01","options":[{"key":"A","text":"4800"},{"key":"B","text":"5000"},{"key":"C","text":"5200"},{"key":"D","text":"5832"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"基期量=现期量÷(1+增长率)=5400÷1.08=5000亿元，因此选B。","knowledgePoints":["基期量","增长率"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-002","category":"资料分析","subtype":"比重","difficulty":"easy","stem":"2025年第三产业增加值占该市地区生产总值的比重为多少？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-01","options":[{"key":"A","text":"45%"},{"key":"B","text":"50%"},{"key":"C","text":"55%"},{"key":"D","text":"60%"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"比重=第三产业增加值÷地区生产总值=2970÷5400=55%，因此选C。","knowledgePoints":["现期比重"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-003","category":"资料分析","subtype":"增长量","difficulty":"medium","stem":"2025年该市第二产业增加值比2024年增加约多少亿元？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-01","options":[{"key":"A","text":"180"},{"key":"B","text":"196"},{"key":"C","text":"216"},{"key":"D","text":"240"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"2024年第二产业增加值=2160÷1.10≈1963.6亿元，增长量=2160-1963.6≈196.4亿元，最接近196亿元，因此选B。","knowledgePoints":["增长量","基期量"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-004","category":"资料分析","subtype":"平均数","difficulty":"medium","stem":"2025年该市人均地区生产总值约为多少万元？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-01","options":[{"key":"A","text":"5.0"},{"key":"B","text":"5.5"},{"key":"C","text":"6.0"},{"key":"D","text":"6.5"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"5400亿元÷900万人=6万元/人，单位换算后人均地区生产总值为6.0万元，因此选C。","knowledgePoints":["平均数","单位换算"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-005","category":"资料分析","subtype":"综合判断","difficulty":"hard","stem":"关于该市经济与人口，能够推出的是：","materialId":"data-analysis-material-01","options":[{"key":"A","text":"2024年常住人口为920万人"},{"key":"B","text":"2025年第二产业增加值占地区生产总值的比重超过45%"},{"key":"C","text":"2025年三次产业增加值之比为1∶8∶11"},{"key":"D","text":"2024年地区生产总值不足4900亿元"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"三次产业增加值270∶2160∶2970，各除以270得1∶8∶11，C正确。2024年人口为900-20=880万人；第二产业比重为2160÷5400=40%；2024年GDP为5000亿元，故A、B、D均错误。","knowledgePoints":["综合判断","比重","基期量"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},

    {"id":"data-analysis-006","category":"资料分析","subtype":"比重","difficulty":"easy","stem":"2025年高技术制造业增加值占规模以上工业增加值的比重为多少？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-02","options":[{"key":"A","text":"16%"},{"key":"B","text":"20%"},{"key":"C","text":"25%"},{"key":"D","text":"35%"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"1600÷8000=20%，因此高技术制造业增加值占比为20%，选B。","knowledgePoints":["现期比重"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-007","category":"资料分析","subtype":"平均数","difficulty":"easy","stem":"2025年平均每家规模以上工业企业实现增加值约为多少万元？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-02","options":[{"key":"A","text":"6923"},{"key":"B","text":"7692"},{"key":"C","text":"8000"},{"key":"D","text":"8320"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"8000亿元÷10400家≈0.7692亿元/家，即约7692万元/家，因此选B。","knowledgePoints":["平均数","单位换算"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-008","category":"资料分析","subtype":"倍数","difficulty":"medium","stem":"2025年装备制造业增加值是高技术制造业增加值的多少倍？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-02","options":[{"key":"A","text":"1.25"},{"key":"B","text":"1.50"},{"key":"C","text":"1.75"},{"key":"D","text":"2.00"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"倍数=2800÷1600=1.75，因此选C。","knowledgePoints":["倍数"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-009","category":"资料分析","subtype":"基期量","difficulty":"medium","stem":"2024年该省高技术制造业增加值约为多少亿元？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-02","options":[{"key":"A","text":"1280"},{"key":"B","text":"1400"},{"key":"C","text":"1429"},{"key":"D","text":"1792"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"基期量=1600÷1.12≈1428.6亿元，约为1429亿元，因此选C。","knowledgePoints":["基期量"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
    {"id":"data-analysis-010","category":"资料分析","subtype":"比重变化","difficulty":"hard","stem":"与2024年相比，2025年高技术制造业增加值占规模以上工业增加值的比重约提高多少个百分点？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-02","options":[{"key":"A","text":"0.5"},{"key":"B","text":"1.0"},{"key":"C","text":"1.5"},{"key":"D","text":"2.0"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"2025年占比为20%。2024年高技术制造业增加值约1428.6亿元，规模以上工业增加值=8000÷1.064≈7518.8亿元，2024年占比约19.0%，故提高约1.0个百分点，选B。","knowledgePoints":["比重变化","基期比重"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},

