    {"id":"data-analysis-038","category":"资料分析","subtype":"平均数增长率","difficulty":"medium","stem":"2025年国内游客人均旅游收入同比增长约多少？","materialId":"data-analysis-material-08","options":[{"key":"A","text":"6.0%"},{"key":"B","text":"6.7%"},{"key":"C","text":"8.0%"},{"key":"D","text":"48.0%"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"人均收入增速=(1+收入增速)÷(1+游客量增速)-1=1.28÷1.20-1≈6.67%，约6.7%，选B。","knowledgePoints":["平均数增长率"],"sourceRefs":[],"status":"draft"},
